1
00:00:00,727 --> 00:00:05,567
(Sheldon:)...by building an exact replica of Jerusalem
in the middle of the Mexican desert.

2
00:00:06,191 --> 00:00:07,231
(Gablehouser:)To what end?

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:11,820
(Sheldon:)You know, it's like the baseball movie.
"Build it and they will come."

4
00:00:12,572 --> 00:00:13,612
(Gablehouser:)Who will come?

5
00:00:13,782 --> 00:00:15,662
(Sheldon:)The Jewish people.

6
00:00:15,825 --> 00:00:17,075
What if they don't come?

7
00:00:17,243 --> 00:00:19,073
(Sheldon:)We'll make it nice, put out a spread.

8
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:22,460
Okay, well, speaking of spreads...

9
00:00:22,624 --> 00:00:25,544
...we're having a welcoming party
this afternoon for Mr. Kim...

10
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:29,590
- ...who's agreed to join us at the university.
- Of course he has.

11
00:00:29,756 --> 00:00:33,806
(Sheldon:)The oracle told us little Neo was the one.

12
00:00:35,053 --> 00:00:36,633
You can see the matrix, can't you?

13
00:00:36,805 --> 00:00:41,555
Okay, well, obviously, you're very busy
with your, ah, um...

14
00:00:41,726 --> 00:00:42,766
(Gablehouser:)Come, Dennis.

15
00:00:44,729 --> 00:00:48,529
(Gablehouser:)You'll have to excuse Dr. Cooper.
He's been under a lot of, um...

16
00:00:48,691 --> 00:00:50,861
(Gablehouser:)He's nuts.

17
00:00:51,569 --> 00:00:54,069
[SHELDON HUMMING "CIELITO LINDO"]

18
00:00:54,239 --> 00:00:56,449
[SINGING IN HEBREW]

19
00:00:56,866 --> 00:01:02,026
(Sheldon(voice off, sings to a Mexican tune):)They'll come, they'll settle
And I'll win the prize

